    "sub_name": "近代學術專題",
    "sub_ename": "THE RESEARCH TO THE MODERN AGES OF CHINESE ACADEMIC SCHOLARS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程講授近代中?學術文化的發生背景、近代學術重點人物和作品、流派開展和影響。課程重於古為今用，透過近代經典作品的研讀，幫助提升同學對中國文化精神的了解和古今重要文獻的閱讀能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course teaches the background of modern Chinese academic culture, key figures and works of modern academics, and the development and influence of schools. The course focuses on applying the past to the present. Through the study of modern classic works, it helps students improve their understanding of the spirit of Chinese culture and their reading ability of important ancient and modern documents.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
